  m_text: 'INSTRUCTIONS(FOR PC PLAYERS.):


    -TO SHOOT :: PRESS "S" OR ARROW DOWN.

    -TO
    JUMP :: PRESS "W" OR ARROW UP OR SPACE BAR.

    -TO JUMP HIGH :: LONG PRESS
    THE KEYS.

